  "_about": "Runway cluster, generated by tools/gen_runway.py (edit that and regenerate): two rev bars leaning apart towards the driver like a runway, numbered per thousand, lit from the far end down to the revs and red past the redline; READY, the gear, the drive mode and the speed between them; two ring gauges on the right (power and torque out of the box); a G-meter on the left, or four readouts (\"runwayLeft\"); a top bar with the range and what is playing; a bottom row with two segmented bars (coolant and boost), the clock and the outside temperature. Every ring, bar and left readout is a readout slot. BMW's gear letter left uncovered. No map window. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
